    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d457">

                <pb facs="0566" n="498" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg498"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72/2327¾: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The German Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bernstorff</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-16T10:07:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 16, 1915—10:07 a. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:15 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your letter followed me here where I have urgent business for a day. I am sending
                    one more wireless to Berlin. It is really not our fault if the events of the
                    last weeks postponed a solution of the older question.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Bernstorff</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
